cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "PCM Latent Heat Storage Dataset — ML- and CFD-ready"
version: "1.7"
date-released: "2026-11-01"
authors:
  - family-names: "Sathiya Satchi"
    given-names: "Christopher"
repository-code: "https://github.com/christophersathya-bit/PCM_latent_storage_dataset"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Curated dataset of 766 solid–liquid phase change materials (PCMs) and 197
  composite PCMs for latent heat thermal energy storage (−74 °C to 1085 °C),
  covering organics, salt hydrates, molten salts, metals, eutectics, composites
  and commercial products. Every row carries its source and a data-quality flag.
  Includes a machine-learning-ready table (52 columns) and a CFD-ready subset of
  302 materials in SI units.
keywords:
  - phase change materials
  - latent heat
  - thermal energy storage
  - machine learning
  - CFD
  - dataset
